{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "437ce55d-21af-42c1-846c-c8f3d93606c8",
		"name": "Core - Login",
		"description": "Autenticação e provisionamento via **core-backend** (Hub) em `{{coreBaseUrl}}`.\n\n**Fluxo recomendado (Runner):**\n1. **00 - Auth** → Login Admin\n2. **01 - Criar usuários** → um por perfil\n3. **02 - Login por perfil** → salva userIds e tokens\n4. **03 - Turma** → curso, turma e vínculos\n5. **04 - Re-login** → TEACHER/REP/STUDENT (JWT com `classes`)\n6. Rode **Comunicados - {PERFIL}**\n\n**Domínios de e-mail:**\n- SENAI: `@sc.senai.br` | WEG: `@weg.net`\n- TEACHER: `@edu.sc.senai.br`\n- STUDENT/REPRESENTATIVE: `@estudante.sesisenai.org.br`",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "00 - Auth",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "01 - Login Admin",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{coreBaseUrl}}/auth/login",
							"host": [
								"{{coreBaseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"auth",
								"login"
							]
						},
						"description": "Admin pré-cadastrado: admin@portal.test / 123456",
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
						}
					},
					"response": [],
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    const body = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.environment.set('tokenAdmin', body.accessToken);",
									"    pm.environment.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
									"    pm.environment.set('refreshToken', body.refreshToken);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "02 - Refresh Token",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
